This Terraform configuration provisions an AWS ElastiCache Redis cache to reduce the number of direct database calls by allowing applications to cache frequently accessed data. It creates a VPC, private subnets, a security group allowing Redis traffic within the VPC, an ElastiCache subnet group, and a single-node Redis replication group.

